# Hellish Sideswipe {B}: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact or creature. Destroy target
# creature or Vehicle. If the sacrificed permanent was a Vehicle, draw a card." (CR 118.8, 701.8, 608.2h). Bot1 sacrifices
# its Dependable Quinjet (a Vehicle that is no creature) and destroys its own Ornithopter: one of your own is a legal
# target. The Mox Ruby (an artifact that is neither creature nor Vehicle) and the Swamp are refused as targets, and the
# Swamp as the sacrifice too; the Quinjet is taken, and the card drawn leaves the hand at two cards after the Sideswipe is cast.

